# "Base power is equal to the number of cards in your hand" is a layer 7b effect (CR 613.4b); +N/+N effects and +1/+1 counters
# are layer 7c (CR 613.4c) and apply after it whatever their timestamps. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Battlefield Improvisation at Ms.
# Marvel (+2/+2 until end of turn; the trigger resolves first, so the pump is newer than the first grant) and then Snakeskin Veil
# (a +1/+1 counter; its trigger's grant is newer than the pump). With two cards in hand each time her power is the hand plus the
# pump (4), then plus the counter (5), and her toughness is her own 4 plus 2 and 1. On turn 4 the grant and the pump are over but
# the counter stays: 2/5.

